 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
 
+| POST | `/orgs/{oid}/users/{uid}/transfer` | `{"toOrgId"}` → 200 `{"id","orgId"}` |
+
+Transfer moves a user to another organization. Only an org admin of `{oid}` (the
+user's current organization) may do it: caller not in `{oid}` or target not in
+`{oid}` → 404, not an org admin → 403, empty/same/unknown `toOrgId` → 400. The
+user leaves all their projects, their tasks become unassigned, and the org admin
+flag is cleared.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
 ## Access rules
